y and what Morpheus has to  offer next PlayStation now the concept  the PlayStation now is explained at  length at e3 introducing a streaming  service of this nature in Europe is  complicated and difficult and we've  always said that we will not introduce  PlayStation now until we can guarantee  proper PlayStation levels of quality  anywhere that we launch so I'm pleased  to announce tonight the PlayStation now  is coming to Europe in 2015 with the  first beta beginning in the UK finally  PlayStation TV we were thrilled at the  reaction PlayStation TV got at e3  PlayStation TV functions as a gaming  console that gives access to most PS  Vita titles as well as ps1 and PSP  classics and and this is something that  we're particularly excited about as a  way to enjoy Remote Play functionality  by pairing your ps4 with a second  television in your home PlayStation TV  is a versatile entry-level option for  the gamer and PlayStation TV will launch  across the PAL territory on November the  14th priced at 99 euros including three  digital games
 

